OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FOver 80,000 motorists lose their
OL,7,     Fdriving licence every year and
OL,8,     Fnearly ten percent of those are
OL,9,     Falready banned from driving. In
OL,10,     Fthis edition, cops clamp down on
OL,11,     Funlicensed drivers.
OL,12,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FDerbyshire's police and other
OL,14,     Femergency services are called to
OL,15,     Fover 1600 crashes each year. In
OL,16,     Fthis episode, cops deal with
OL,17,     Fcrashes and distracted drivers
OL,18,     Fputting lives on the line.
